        "original_id": "1d150720-0be2-5183-b297-24aae8372748",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: KWPW, KAND\n- People: Bill McCutcheon, James William McCutcheon\n- Topics: radio broadcasting, station ownership, call signs\n\nFacts:\n- James William McCutcheon was born on May 23, 1924, and died on January 9, 2002.\n- James William McCutcheon was an American character actor known for film, television, and theatre roles, and several of those roles won Emmy and Tony awards.\n- For many years, the KAND call sign was assigned to the station now called KWPW.\n- KWPW is a radio station at 107.9 FM branded as \"Power 108\" that broadcasts a contemporary hit radio format.\n- KWPW is currently owned by Bill McCutcheon.",
